              <description>EPWM Compare Down Count Interrupt Flag\nFlag is set by hardware when EPWM counter down count and reaches EPWM_CMPDATn, software can clear this bit by writing 1 to it.\nNote: In complementary mode, CMPDIF1, 3, 5 is used as another CMPDIF for channel 0, 2, 4.</description>
