              <description>Active Shied Tamper 1 Detect Enable Bit 2\nNote: The reference is TLIRC 32K-clock. Tamper detector needs sync 2 ~ 3 TLIRC 32K-clock.</description>
              <bitOffset>12</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <enumeratedValues>
